    excerpt: `The brain is the control center of the human body, responsible for every thought, movement, memory, emotion, and vital function. Even a small abnormal growth within the brain can interfere with these essential activities and significantly impact a person's quality of life. A brain tumor is one such condition that requires timely diagnosis, expert evaluation, and appropriate treatment. Although hearing the term "brain tumor" can be alarming, it is important to understand that not all brain tumors are cancerous, and many can be treated successfully with modern medical advancements.`,
