    title: `Slip Disc (Herniated Disc): Symptoms, Causes, Treatment & When Surgery Is Needed`,
    excerpt: `Back pain is one of the most common health problems affecting people of all ages. Whether it is caused by prolonged sitting, lifting heavy objects, poor posture, or age-related wear and tear, back pain can interfere with daily life and reduce productivity. One of the leading causes of persistent back and leg pain is a slip disc, also known as a herniated disc or prolapsed intervertebral disc.`,
