    excerpt: `Lower back pain is common and can affect people of different ages and lifestyles. While many episodes improve with rest and conservative care, pain that travels from the lower back or buttock into the leg may indicate sciatica. It can interfere with sitting, standing, walking, driving, working, and sleeping.`,
