    excerpt: `A stroke is a medical emergency that occurs when blood flow to part of the brain is blocked or when a blood vessel in the brain ruptures. Since brain cells need a continuous supply of oxygen, delayed treatment can result in permanent brain damage, disability, or life-threatening complications.`,
