    title: `Thyroid Disorders: Symptoms, Causes, Types, Diagnosis and Treatment`,
    excerpt: `The thyroid is a small butterfly-shaped gland located at the front of the neck, but it plays an important role in regulating metabolism, energy use, heart rate, temperature, and many other body functions.`,
