    excerpt: `Joint pain, stiffness, and difficulty moving are common complaints, particularly among adults as they get older. However, not every type of joint pain has the same cause. Osteoarthritis (OA) and rheumatoid arthritis (RA) are two common forms of arthritis, but they are fundamentally different conditions.`,
