    title: `Interventional Oncology: How Image-Guided Procedures Are Transforming Cancer Care`,
    excerpt: `Cancer treatment has evolved significantly over the last several decades. Surgery, chemotherapy, radiation therapy, immunotherapy, targeted therapy, and other treatments have become important components of modern oncology. At the same time, advances in medical imaging and minimally invasive technology have created another specialized field: Interventional Oncology.`,
