    title: `Interventional Radiology for Liver Cancer: Advanced Image-Guided Treatment Options`,
    excerpt: `Liver cancer is a complex disease that requires individualized treatment planning. The most appropriate treatment depends on the type of cancer, stage of disease, tumor size and location, number of tumors, liver function, and the patient's overall health.`,
    category: 'Radiology',
