    title: `Embolization in Interventional Radiology: Uses, Procedure, Benefits and Recovery`,
    excerpt: `Embolization is an important minimally invasive technique used in modern Interventional Radiology. It involves deliberately blocking blood flow through a selected blood vessel using specialized materials.`,
