    title: `Understanding Knee Pain: Common Causes and When to Seek Orthopedic Care`,
    excerpt: `Knee pain is a common problem that can affect people of different age groups. It may appear after an injury, develop gradually with age, or occur because of excessive physical activity. While occasional discomfort may improve with rest, persistent or worsening knee pain should not be ignored.`,
    category: 'Orthopedics',
