    title: `Robotic Joint Replacement: How Technology Is Changing Knee Surgery`,
    excerpt: `Joint replacement surgery has evolved considerably with advances in medical technology. Robotic-assisted techniques are among the developments that have introduced greater use of digital planning and technology-assisted precision during selected joint replacement procedures.`,
