    title: `Sports Injuries and Arthroscopy: Understanding Modern Knee Treatment`,
    excerpt: `Sports and physical activity provide important benefits for strength, fitness, flexibility, and overall well-being. However, activities that involve running, jumping, sudden turns, or physical contact can sometimes result in injuries. Knee injuries are particularly common among athletes and physically active individuals.`,
    category: 'Orthopedics',
