    title: `Heart Health After 40: Important Steps to Protect Your Cardiovascular System`,
    excerpt: `Heart health deserves attention at every stage of life, but cardiovascular risk can change as people grow older. After the age of 40, maintaining healthy lifestyle habits and monitoring important health indicators can become increasingly important for reducing cardiovascular risk.`,
    category: 'Cardiology',
