    excerpt: `Knee pain can gradually change the way a person walks, works, exercises, and even performs simple daily activities. For people with advanced knee arthritis or severe joint damage, conservative treatments may eventually provide limited relief. In such situations, knee replacement surgery can help restore mobility and improve quality of life. With advances in orthopedic technology, robotic-assisted knee replacement has become an important option for selected patients.`,
