    excerpt: `Knee injuries can affect people across different age groups. Athletes may develop ligament or cartilage injuries, while adults can experience meniscus problems, inflammation, or damage associated with wear and tear. When symptoms persist and conservative treatment is not enough, arthroscopic knee surgery may be considered for selected conditions.`,
