    title: `Arthroscopic Knee Surgery: Understanding Treatment for Meniscus and Ligament Injuries`,
    excerpt: `The knee is a complex joint that allows people to walk, run, jump, turn, and perform countless everyday movements. Because it carries significant loads and is involved in many physical activities, it can also be vulnerable to injuries.`,
    category: 'Orthopedics',
