    title: `Sports Injuries and Knee Ligament Tears: Getting the Right Orthopedic Treatment`,
    excerpt: `Sports can improve strength, fitness, flexibility, and overall health, but sudden movements and high-impact activities can sometimes result in injuries. The knee is particularly vulnerable during sports that involve running, jumping, twisting, or rapid changes in direction.`,
    category: 'Orthopedics',
