    title: `High Cholesterol and Heart Disease: Understanding the Hidden Cardiovascular Risk`,
    excerpt: `Cholesterol is often discussed during routine health check-ups, but many people do not realize how closely cholesterol levels are connected with cardiovascular health. Unlike conditions that produce noticeable symptoms, high cholesterol can develop quietly for years. A person may feel perfectly healthy while changes are taking place inside the blood vessels.`,
    category: 'Cardiology',
