    excerpt: `Getting out of breath after intense exercise is normal. But what if you become breathless while walking a short distance, climbing a few steps, or performing activities that previously felt easy? Unexpected changes in breathing deserve attention because shortness of breath can sometimes be connected to a cardiovascular problem.`,
