    title: `Diabetes and Heart Health: Why Blood Sugar Control Matters for Your Cardiovascular System`,
    excerpt: `Managing diabetes is not limited to watching your blood glucose readings. Over time, diabetes can affect blood vessels and increase the likelihood of cardiovascular problems. The risk becomes particularly important when high blood sugar occurs together with hypertension, abnormal cholesterol, excess weight, smoking, or inactivity.`,
    category: 'General Medicine',
