    title: `Hernia: Can It Heal Without Surgery?`,
    excerpt: `A small swelling or bulge in the abdomen or groin may seem harmless, particularly if it does not hurt. Many people wonder whether they can simply wait for a hernia to disappear.`,
    category: 'General & Laparoscopic Surgery',
